{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jodcXvv2zN1794381719.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國城南市有巴士撞向逾30輛車，最少57人受傷，其中9人傷勢嚴重。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SK.CRASH-1200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DCe9o5e8Ot1794368307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發在早上約七時半，一輛巴士在城南市盆唐區撞上前方等候交通燈的4輛巴士、1輛貨車和27輛私家車，行駛百多米後撞到路中心分隔護攔才停下。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SK.CRASH-1200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U4OMIVZISi1794368328.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>涉事巴士司機通過酒精測試，警方將對他進行藥物檢測。司機報稱煞車失靈，警方正調查事故原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.829094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.815951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:10.752613+00:00","content_hash":"c682a8dba6ef0ee33cdae998070e8c85250f0ce06eca7c5502a084508902e9bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.829094+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}